  "releaseNotes": "Adds extension data for 4.x payloads and unquoted annotation keys in custom 4.4.\n- Adds [ToonExtensionData]: 4.x typed decoding captures keys that match no member into one IDictionary<string, object?> or Dictionary<string, object?> property (objects as Dictionary<string, object?>, arrays as List<object?>, numbers as double)\n- Adds 4.x encoding of extension data entries as sibling keys after the declared members, including table columns and custom 4.4 row spills; a member wins any key collision\n- Adds NotSupportedException for more than one extension data property or an unsupported property type; V3_0 and CustomLegacy ignore the attribute\n- Improves custom 4.4 output by writing annotation keys such as @id, @metadata, $ref, @odata.context and Raven-Clr-Type without quotes ('@' and '$' anywhere, '-' after the first character); official profiles still quote them\n- Updates DevOp.Toon.Core dependency to 0.3.0",
